            <input type="text" class="demo-search" placeholder="Route pattern..." value="src/docs/[...slug]/page.deshi" readonly />
            <ul class="fruit-list">
              <li><code>/</code> → src/page.deshi</li>
              <li><code>/docs</code> → src/docs/page.mdx</li>
              <li><code>/blog/[id]</code> → dynamic route</li>
              <li><code>/shop/[[...all]]</code> → catch-all</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/docs/routing" class="text-link">Read routing guide →</a>
          </div>
